    "title": "Explorers take down Fargo-Moorhead 2-1, secure American Association West Division postseason berth - NewsBreak",
    "text": "FARGO, N.D. (KCAU) – The Sioux City Explorers are the first team in the American Association to secure a postseason berth following its 2-1 win at Fargo-Moorhead. Sioux City starter Kyle Marman kept the RedHawks bats at bay, striking out six batters in six inning while allowing one run. DShawn Knowles continues his hot streak with a hit and one RBI while new acquisition Michael Quiñones led the team with a pair of hits. The X’s will look to sweep Fargo-Moorhead with a win in the series finale on Thursday night at 7:05 p.m. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to SiouxlandProud | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
